Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第2季第11集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.12,0:00:04.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,老爸希望我们继承他的遗志{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad wants us to pick up where he left off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.25,0:00:07.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,救助他人 猎杀恶魔 家族事业{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saving people, hunting things, the family business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:10.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在老爸死前说了些{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before Dad died, he told me something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.51,0:00:11.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,关于你的事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.76,0:00:13.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 说了什么？- 说我可能会杀了你 萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - That I might have to kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.88,0:00:16.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 这到底是什么意思？- 我不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's that supposed to mean? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.22,0:00:18.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他知道那魔鬼对我有什么计划？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he know the demon's plans for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.22,0:00:20.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是不是会变成魔鬼什么的？你是谁？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I supposed to go dark side? Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.39,0:00:23.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 求你了 你有危险 - 你叫什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please. You're in danger. - What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.81,0:00:25.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 阿瓦·威尔森 - 你是我们其中的一员{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ava Wilson. - You must be one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:28.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我们是谁？- 有超能力的人 就像我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One of who? - One of the psychics, like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.73,0:00:30.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还有像我们一样的人存在{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are others like us out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.57,0:00:32.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们都是什么事的一部分{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we're all a part of something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.49,0:00:34.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我可不是你们中的一员 知道吗？看到这个了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not part of anything. Okay? You see this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:37.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,八星期后我就要结婚了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am getting married in eight weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.24,0:00:38.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这事你控制不了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't run from this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:40.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,而且你也不能一直保护我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you can't protect me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:44.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但我会尽全力{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.37,0:00:46.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 也许我能帮上忙 - 你做的已经够多了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe I can help. - You've done all you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.25,0:00:48.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,回到你未婚夫身边吧 在他身边你会安全的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back to your fiancé. You'll be safe there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.25,0:00:52.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,保证完事后打电话给我 我保证{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Promise me you'll call then. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.67,0:00:54.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,阿瓦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ava.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.57,0:01:19.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,大部分东西都在这里了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of the stuff is up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.37,0:01:21.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但还是难以相信你要关了这旅馆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe you're closing, Ms. Thompson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.79,0:01:23.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我父母是在这里订婚的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, my parents got engaged here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.95,0:01:25.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我祖父母也是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My grandparents too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.54,0:01:27.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 很多人都是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, a lot of people did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:29.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那些盒子在走廊尽头{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boxes are at the end of the hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.75,0:01:32.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 需要帮忙吗？- 不需要 女士 我自己行的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Need any help? - Oh, no, madam, I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.30,0:01:40.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他要拿走我们的玩具了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna take our toys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.55,0:01:43.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,只是那些你不玩的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only the ones you don't play with anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:45.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你有的玩具已经够多了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not like you don't have enough already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.93,0:01:48.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 婊子养的 - 婊子养的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Son of a bitch. - Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.73,0:01:51.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 管好自己的嘴 - 玛吉先说的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watch your mouth. - Maggie said it first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:53.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,玛吉 你也要管好你的嘴{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch your mouth too, Maggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.02,0:02:33.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,晚安 塔比瑟{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, Tabitha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.01,0:03:06.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,喔 上帝啊 是的 你在吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God! Yes, yes, are you there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.35,0:03:08.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,请快派人过来 马上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to send someone, right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.27,0:03:10.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,救护车 有意外发生{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An ambulance. There's been an accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.39,0:03:14.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他在楼梯上跌倒了 我不知道 他好像…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He fell on the stairs. I don't know. I think he's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.98,0:03:18.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,泰勒 不要看{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tyler. Don't look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.65,0:03:19.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不要看{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.94,0:03:21.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.95,0:03:24.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,苏珊·汤普森{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Susan Thompson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.83,0:03:29.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,快点 快点过来 我…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just Just hurry! Hurry. I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.16,0:03:33.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 我不知道 我没有看到{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't know. I didn't see it happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.81,0:03:49.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.31,0:03:51.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.60,0:03:53.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谢了 埃伦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Ellen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.31,0:03:55.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 她怎么说？- 没什么发现{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd she say? - She got nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.15,0:03:57.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我正在查我能想到的所有数据库{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, I've been checking every database:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.69,0:03:59.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,联邦政府的 州政府的 地方的也查了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Federal, state and local.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:01.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没人有阿瓦的消息{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's heard anything about Ava.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.65,0:04:03.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,她就是… 像空气一样消失了 你知道吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She just-Into thin air, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.91,0:04:06.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那你这里有消息吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:07.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没什么进展{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Same as before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.58,0:04:09.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 没事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry, man. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.20,0:04:12.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,埃伦有一个消息{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellen did have one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.33,0:04:14.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在康涅狄格州肯尔沃有一家旅馆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hotel in Cornwall, Connecticut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.71,0:04:16.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在过去的三星期里 发生了两桩怪事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two freak accidents in the past three weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.13,0:04:18.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那和阿瓦有什么关系？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, what's that have to do with Ava?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.13,0:04:21.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是工作 我是说一位女士在浴盘里淹死{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a job. I mean, a lady drowned in the bathtub.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.30,0:04:25.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,接着几天前又一位男士摔死在楼梯上 而且头被转了个180度{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few days ago, a guy falls down the stairs, head turns a complete 180.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.09,0:04:28.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这一点都不寻常 不是吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which isn't exactly normal, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.30,0:04:31.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不知道 也许这什么也不是 但我和埃伦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, Dean, it might be nothing, but I told Ellen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.39,0:04:33.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 说了会查下这事的 - 你说了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...we'd think about it. - You did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:34.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,说了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:39.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你好象很惊讶 - 是的 觉得这…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You seem surprised. - Well, yeah, it's just, you know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.44,0:04:42.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不是以前萨姆·温彻斯特的作风 不是吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not the patented Sam Winchester way, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.24,0:04:45.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 那应该是什么作风？- 你会先找到阿瓦在哪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What way is that? - Just figured after Ava...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.66,0:04:49.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,阴郁的听着伤感的音乐{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there'd be, you know, more angst and droopy music...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.03,0:04:51.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看着雨中流水的窗户{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and staring out the rainy windows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:55.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了我不说了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'll shut up now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:59.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,听着 是我让她回去的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm the one who told her to go back home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.09,0:05:01.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,现在她的未婚夫死了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now her fiancé's dead...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.09,0:05:06.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那魔鬼又把她弄得不知去向？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and some demon's taken her off to God knows where. You know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.43,0:05:09.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们已经找了一个月了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been looking for a month now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.76,0:05:11.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但还是没有头绪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we got nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:17.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我没有放弃找她 但我也不让其他人去死{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm not giving up on her but I'm not gonna let other people die either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.94,0:05:19.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们要尽我们的所能去救人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta save as many people as we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:25.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哇哦 那样的态度 对我来说是太过于健康了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, that attitude is just way too healthy for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.95,0:05:28.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我现在真的不舒服了 谢了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm officially uncomfortable now, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.41,0:05:33.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 打电话给埃伦 告诉她这案子我们接了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, call Ellen, tell her we'll take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.59,0:05:48.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这里真是太好了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, this is sweet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.30,0:05:52.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我从没在这种地方工作过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We never get to work jobs like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:53.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哪种？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.35,0:05:56.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,闹鬼的老房子 你知道的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old school haunted houses, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.10,0:06:02.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迷雾 秘密的客人 很娘的英式发音{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fog, secret passageways, sissy British accents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.65,0:06:05.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果我们走进屋里 就可能会变成佛瑞德和达芙妮{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might even run into Fred and Daphne while we're inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.24,0:06:10.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,达芙妮 我喜欢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daphne, love her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.20,0:06:14.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 等一下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, wait a sec.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.04,0:06:18.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不知道闹鬼不是唯一的问题了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not so sure "haunted" is the problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.33,0:06:20.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么意思？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.25,0:06:22.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你看下这里的图案？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see this pattern here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.13,0:06:25.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,五点的梅花形 是五点咒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a quincunx. It's a five-spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.92,0:06:27.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 五点咒 - 没错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Five-spot? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.47,0:06:29.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 那不是咒符符咒吗？- 没错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's used for Hoodoo spell work? - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.63,0:06:33.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你用血把这里涂满 就能保护你不受敌人攻击{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fill this thing with blood weed, you got a powerful charm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.18,0:06:34.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但这里没有血{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I don't see any blood weed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.18,0:06:37.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你不觉得这地方{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you think this place is a little too...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:39.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不太像是下过咒符咒的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}white meat for Hoodoo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.85,0:06:41.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.94,0:06:49.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你们需要什么？- 嗨{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I help you? - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.70,0:06:51.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 我们需要一间房住两天{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'd like a room for a couple of nights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.95,0:06:54.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:57.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 - 没关系{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry about that. - No problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.29,0:07:00.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,恭喜你们 你们可能将成为这里最后的客人了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, congratulations. You could be some of our final guests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.62,0:07:02.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,听起来有不祥预兆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds vaguely ominous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.13,0:07:06.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不是那意思 我意思是这个月底这店就要关了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'm sorry. I mean, we're closing at the end of the month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.17,0:07:09.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,让我猜猜 你们来这里是淘古董的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me guess. You guys are here antiquing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.43,0:07:13.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道？- 你们看上去就像那么回事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How'd you know? - You just look the type.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:15.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,加长的床？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So a king-sized bed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.10,0:07:17.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么？不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.39,0:07:20.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 不 我们要两张单人床{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No. We're two singles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.89,0:07:22.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们是兄弟{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're just brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.85,0:07:25.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,喔 不好意思{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.90,0:07:29.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,为什么说我们是那样子的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you mean that we looked the type?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.57,0:07:34.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你知道 说到古董{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, speaking of antiques...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.24,0:07:37.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你前门旁的那个瓮很有意思{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have a really interesting urn on the front porch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.41,0:07:38.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那个你哪弄来的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd you get that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.87,0:07:40.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我也不知道 我生下来就有了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no idea. It's been there forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.04,0:07:43.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是钥匙 马霍·戈夫先生{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go, Mr. Mahoggoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:47.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你们的房间是237 - 好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You'll be staying in Room 237. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.46,0:07:50.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,舍温 你能领这两位先生 去他们的房间吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sherwin, could you show these gentlemen to their rooms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:52.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,让我猜猜{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.59,0:07:54.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,玩古董的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Antiquers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.10,0:07:57.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我可以帮你搬包{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could give you a hand with that bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.10,0:08:00.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 不用 - 好吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got it. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:02.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 那这店要关了？- 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So the hotel is closing up? - Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.69,0:08:04.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,苏珊想开好这店的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Susan tried to make a go of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.65,0:08:06.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但住店的人却没有以前的多了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the guests don't come like they used to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.94,0:08:09.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 实在是太可惜了 - 没错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Still, it's a damn shame. - Oh, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:12.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,虽然看上去也许还不怎么样 但这里曾经也辉煌过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may not look it anymore, but this place was a palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.99,0:08:16.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,两位副总统来我们这里住过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two different vice-presidents laid their heads on our pillows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.49,0:08:19.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我父母在这里 我就是在这里长大的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My parents worked here. I practically grew up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.16,0:08:21.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我会很想这里的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gonna miss it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:23.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是你们的房间{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's your room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.88,0:08:31.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.55,0:08:40.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你不会那么小气吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna cheap out on me, are you, boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.23,0:08:52.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这真是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.32,0:08:53.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.15,0:08:58.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这真是很常见啊 为什么这里还一直有人住？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's normal. Why the hell would anyone stay here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.32,0:09:00.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这里能经营那么长时间真令人惊讶{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm amazed they kept in business this long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.70,0:09:05.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 受害者一号 琼·爱迪生 43岁{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Victim number one. Joan Edison, 43 years old, a realtor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:07.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是这个旅店的地产经济人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Handling the sale of the hotel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:10.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,受害者二号 拉里·威廉斯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And victim number two was Larry Williams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:13.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 只是帮忙来搬点东西的 - 有一个关联{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Moving some stuff out to Goodwill. - There's a connection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.92,0:09:14.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们都是和这店关闭有关系的人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're shutting the place down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.88,0:09:17.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 也许有人不想离开这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.Maybe someone doesn't wanna leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.43,0:09:19.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 所以用咒符来回击 - 那你认为那个下咒的人为是谁{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're using Hoodoo. - Who is our witch doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.89,0:09:22.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 那个苏珊？- 好像不太像{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That Susan lady? - No, it doesn't seem likely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.43,0:09:25.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 她是想卖了这店的 - 那还有谁 舍温？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I mean, she's the one selling. - So, what then? Sherwin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.69,0:09:28.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.19,0:09:31.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但最棘手的事是 为什么这么多人都认为我们是断背的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The most troubling question is, why do they assume we're gay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.02,0:09:33.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你看上去很壮{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you are kind of butch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.15,0:09:35.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,觉得你精力过人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you're overcompensating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.61,0:09:39.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,大概吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.67,0:09:56.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:09:59.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看这里 又一个咒符{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that. More Hoodoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.98,0:10:14.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi there. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.36,0:10:16.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你们的房间没问题吧？- 蛮好 蛮好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Everything okay with your room? - Yeah.yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.49,0:10:18.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 一切都很好 - 这就好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, everything's great. - Good.{\r}
