Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.59,0:16:12.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 迪恩 你不明白的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Dean! You don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.72,0:16:15.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我救的人越多 我就越能改变{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The more people I save, the more I can change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.51,0:16:18.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 改变什么？- 我的命运 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Change what? - My destiny, Dean!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:22.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧 睡觉时间到了 来吧 大野人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, time for bed. Come on, Sasquatch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:26.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 来吧 我需要你看着我 - 我会的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on.I need you to watch out for me. - I always do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:30.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不是的 你得看着我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no! You have to watch out for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.57,0:16:32.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:35.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果我变成了什么 我不愿成为的东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if I ever turn into something that I'm not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.53,0:16:40.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你得杀了我 - 萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...you have to kill me. - Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.58,0:16:43.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 是爸爸告诉你的 你一定要{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, Dad told you to do it. You have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.71,0:16:44.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 但老爸很混{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? Well, Dad's an ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.12,0:16:47.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他不该说任何事的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He never should've said anything. You don't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:52.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你不该和你的孩子说那种废话 - 不 他说的很对{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't lay that crap on your kids. - No, he was right to say it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.38,0:16:54.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谁知道我会变成什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who knows what I might become?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.76,0:16:56.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看看现在 我周围的人都死了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even now, everyone around me dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.22,0:16:59.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不是没死吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, I'm not dying, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.47,0:17:01.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你也是啊 来吧 坐下来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And neither are you. Come on, sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.56,0:17:05.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 求你了 迪恩 你是唯一一个可以做这事的人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, please, Dean, you're the only one who can do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.27,0:17:07.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 答应我 迪恩 求你了 - 别这么说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Promise. Dean, please. - Don't ask that of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.48,0:17:10.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你得向我保证{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to promise me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.11,0:17:17.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我保证{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.95,0:17:22.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:26.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.33,0:18:09.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,找到什么古董了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find any good antiques?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.92,0:18:12.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有 只有些烦心的事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No. Got distracted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.50,0:18:14.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,来喝一杯吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.13,0:18:17.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.01,0:18:22.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这么说那个人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So poor guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.14,0:18:24.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他自杀了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killing himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:28.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这种事最近老是发生{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That kind of thing seems to be going around lately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.35,0:18:30.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是啊 是啊 以前的我也听说了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah. I heard about the other ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:34.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这更像是这间旅馆被诅咒了什么的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's almost like this hotel is cursed or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.98,0:18:38.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果人们只记得那些{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every hotel has its spilled blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.53,0:18:41.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在他们所住房间发生过的事的话 你会发现{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If people only knew what's gone on in some of those rooms...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.53,0:18:43.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,每个旅馆都有自己的血案{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they've checked into...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.66,0:18:46.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你对这间旅馆很熟 是吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know a lot about the place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.54,0:18:49.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,连这里的每个钉子都熟{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down to the last nail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.37,0:18:51.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我很想听故事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd love to hear some stories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.04,0:18:56.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,孩子 你不该和一个老人说这话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy, you should never say that to an old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:03.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是苏珊小姐和她的母亲罗斯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is little Miss Susan and her mother, Rose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.05,0:19:06.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,快乐时光啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happier days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.06,0:19:10.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,她们现在不快乐吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not happy now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.98,0:19:14.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,要你离开唯一的家的话 你会快乐吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, would you be, leaving the only home you ever knew?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.11,0:19:17.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我从没有过一个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I never really knew one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:18.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这里是罗斯的家{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, this is Rose's home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.07,0:19:21.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,她在这住了快一个世纪了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been in the family over a century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.53,0:19:23.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这里本来是家族资产{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Used to be the family estate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.24,0:19:26.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但现在她却命在旦夕{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now she gets to live in some senior living graveyard...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.99,0:19:29.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,而他们要把这里推倒了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they tear this place down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.21,0:19:32.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那太糟了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's too bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.58,0:19:36.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我听说罗斯生病了 - 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I hear Rose isn't feeling well either. - No, she isn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.21,0:19:38.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,她怎么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.80,0:19:41.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这不是我该说的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not my business to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.26,0:19:47.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这个是谁？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.72,0:19:49.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Rose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.10,0:19:53.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,小时候的罗斯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When she was a little girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.82,0:20:01.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,和她一起的是谁？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's that with her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.15,0:20:03.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那时她的保姆玛丽{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's her nanny, Marie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.91,0:20:07.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,她照顾罗斯的时间比罗斯的生母还多{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She looked after Rose more than her own mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.14,0:20:33.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,感觉如何 萨姆？把威士忌酒和蒸馏酒混着喝{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you feeling, Sammy? I guess mixing whiskey and Jager...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.35,0:20:35.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不是个好主意吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wasn't such a gangbuster idea, was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.15,0:20:41.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我猜你一定不记得昨晚的事了 是吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll bet you don't remember a thing from last night, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.49,0:20:44.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 我还可以喝龙舌兰酒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can still taste the tequila.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.32,0:20:48.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 有一种很好的治疗宿醉的方法{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know there's a really good hangover remedy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.37,0:20:50.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,用脏烟缸装的肥猪肉三明治{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a greasy pork sandwich served in a dirty ashtray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.16,0:20:54.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 哦 我恨死你了 - 我知道的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, I hate you. - I know you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.71,0:20:56.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 原来祖母罗斯还是孩子的时候{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, turns out when Grandma Rose was a tyke...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.96,0:21:01.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,她有个戴着咒符教项链的黑人保姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she had a Creole nanny who wore a Hoodoo necklace. Ugh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.59,0:21:05.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 所以你觉得是她教罗斯的？- 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So you think she taught Rose Hoodoo? - Yes, I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.47,0:21:09.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.85,0:21:13.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想是时候和罗斯谈谈了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's time we talk to Rose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.23,0:21:15.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 你得先刷刷牙{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to brush your teeth first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.36,0:21:26.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.86,0:21:29.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,苏珊？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Susan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.99,0:21:33.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 没人吧？- 嗯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clear? - Mm-hm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.00,0:22:58.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,汤普森夫人？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Thompson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.29,0:23:04.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,汤普森夫人？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Thompson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.96,0:23:08.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,罗斯？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.13,0:23:15.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你好 汤普森夫人 我们不是来害你的 没事的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Mrs. Thompson, we're not here to hurt you, it's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.73,0:23:20.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,罗斯？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.95,0:23:32.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 这个女人中风了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This woman's had a stroke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.03,0:23:34.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 但是咒符是要用手做出来的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but Hoodoo's hands-on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.62,0:23:37.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你得做药 念咒 做个祭坛{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta mix herbs and chant, build an altar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.83,0:23:40.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 所以不可能是罗斯 - 也许不是咒符{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So it can't be Rose. - Heck, maybe it's not even Hoodoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.87,0:23:42.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,她可以装病的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, she could be faking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.50,0:23:44.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那你要怎么做 用木棍去戳她？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, what do you wanna do, poke her with a stick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.13,0:23:47.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,伙计 你不会用木棍去戳她吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, you're not gonna poke her with a stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.50,0:23:50.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,到底怎么了？你们在这里做什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell? What are you doing in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.51,0:23:52.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,门开着 我们只是和罗斯谈谈{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The door was. We wanted to ask Rose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.80,0:23:54.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看看她 她都被吓坏了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's scared out of her wits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.64,0:23:58.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们给我滚出旅馆 否则我就报警了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you out of my hotel in two minutes or I'm calling the cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.99,0:24:16.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,到你了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your turn. Eightsies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.37,0:24:24.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你开始打包了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you started packing yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.08,0:24:26.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 为什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.38,0:24:29.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我不想搬家 - 我知道 但我们必须走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't wanna move. - Yes, I know. But we have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.05,0:24:33.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 但是玛吉说不允许我们走 - 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maggie says we're not allowed to. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.18,0:24:35.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,泰勒 够了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tyler, enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.09,0:24:37.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,玛吉是你想象出来的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maggie is imaginary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.72,0:24:41.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你够大了不该有想象中的朋友了 我已经不想装下去了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're too old to have an imaginary friend and I'm done pretending.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.23,0:24:47.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢她{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.09,0:25:12.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我可以帮你搬箱子 - 我来就好了 舍温 谢谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I could lug those boxes for you. - I got it, Sherwin, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.26,0:25:14.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.88,0:25:16.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,待会见{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.55,0:27:23.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？- 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You okay? - I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.39,0:27:26.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,快点 快点 我们快进去 快走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, let's get inside. Let's go. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.98,0:27:32.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 威士忌 - 好的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whiskey. - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.81,0:27:34.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道这种感受{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.90,0:27:38.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,到底出了什么事了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell happened out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.36,0:27:40.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你想知道真相吗？- 当然了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want the truth? - Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.24,0:27:42.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,起先我们以为是有人在下咒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First we thought it was some sort of a Hoodoo curse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.91,0:27:44.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是不是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.66,0:27:46.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那里面肯定有个鬼魂在{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was definitely a spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.16,0:27:48.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,给你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.66,0:27:50.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们疯了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.91,0:27:52.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有人说过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.21,0:27:55.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 苏珊 但我们没有时间和你解释了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, we don't exactly have time to ease you into this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.54,0:27:58.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们想知道你母亲是什么时候中风的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we need to know when your mother had the stroke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.25,0:28:00.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 那有什么… - 快点回答{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's that have to do with? - Answer the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.92,0:28:02.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,大约一个月前{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About a month ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.05,0:28:05.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就在血案开始前 明白了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right before the killings began. See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.85,0:28:07.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所以罗斯不是用咒符来害人的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if Rose was working Hoodoo...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.68,0:28:09.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,而是用来保护别人的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but not to hurt anyone, to protect them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.89,0:28:12.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,她用瓮来阻挡鬼魂的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was using the urns to ward off the spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.23,0:28:14.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 中风后她就不能再做了 - 真不敢相信{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Till her stroke. She couldn't anymore. - I don't believe this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.02,0:28:18.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,听着 那辆车不是自己向你撞来的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, that car didn't try to run you down by itself, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.94,0:28:22.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是说 虽然看起来是 但是是被鬼魂所操纵的还是算了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean it did, technically, but the spirit can-Forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.53,0:28:25.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,信不信由你 你和你的家人现在很危险{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe what you want. You and your family are in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.45,0:28:27.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你得把大家都撤出去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right? You need to clear everybody out:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.70,0:28:31.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你的员工 你的母亲 你的女儿们 每个人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your employees, your mother, your daughters, everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.12,0:28:35.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我只有一个女儿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only have one daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.79,0:28:39.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 一个？- 我以为泰勒还有个叫玛吉的姐姐{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One? - Tyler had a sister named Maggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.38,0:28:42.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,玛吉是她想象出来的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maggie's imaginary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.63,0:28:45.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,泰勒在哪？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Tyler?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.68,0:28:54.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,她将和我在一起{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's going to stay here with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.94,0:28:56.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你阻止不了我的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you can't stop me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.77,0:29:00.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你什么也做不了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing you can do about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.78,0:29:05.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,玛吉 不要 你不应该来打扰祖母的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maggie, don't. You're not supposed to bother Grandma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.11,0:29:07.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.49,0:29:12.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,来吧 我们一起玩吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.75,0:29:17.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我们要玩茶会吗？- 我们会很多的茶会{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can we have a tea party? - We can have lots of tea parties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.08,0:29:23.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一直到永远 永远{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forever and ever and ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.52,0:29:34.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,泰勒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tyler?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.31,0:29:41.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 我的天哪 泰勒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God. Tyler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.65,0:29:43.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,泰勒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tyler?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.86,0:29:47.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,她不在这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.66,0:29:52.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,苏珊 你对玛吉了解多少{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Susan. Tell us what you know about Maggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.29,0:29:54.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不是很多或 在我妈生病后 泰勒就开始和她说话了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tyler's been talking about her since Mom got sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.00,0:29:57.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧 你认识有同样名字的人吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Did you ever know anyone by that name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.25,0:29:58.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 想想 想想{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Think.Think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.50,0:30:00.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,曾经住在这里的 也许已经死了的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could be someone that lived here. Passed away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.88,0:30:02.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我的天哪 我母亲有个姐姐就叫玛格丽特{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God, my Mom had a sister named Margaret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.13,0:30:04.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,她很少提起她{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barely spoke about her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.38,0:30:06.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,玛格丽特是不是很小就死在这里了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did she die here when she was a kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.72,0:30:08.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 她是淹死在游泳池里的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She drowned in the pool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.14,0:30:10.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,快来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.32,0:30:32.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不想在这上面 我很害怕{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like it up here. I'm scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.24,0:30:34.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没事的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.91,0:30:36.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你只要跳下去就行了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you have to do is jump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.75,0:30:43.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我不会游泳 - 我知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't swim. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.38,0:30:45.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是不会痛的 我保证{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it won't hurt, I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.09,0:30:48.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,之后我们就能永远在一起了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then we can be together. Forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.30,0:30:52.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,再没人会来打搅了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no one will bother us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.60,0:30:58.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你为什么不跟我和妈咪一起搬走呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you just come with me and Mommy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.39,0:31:02.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,因为我离不开这里 而你离不开我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I can't leave here. And you can't leave me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.78,0:31:08.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,求你了 我不想孤独一人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please? I don't want to be alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.83,0:31:24.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,泰勒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tyler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.21,0:31:28.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 泰勒 - 快呀{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tyler. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.72,0:31:29.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,妈咪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.31,0:31:38.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 有其他入口吗？- 后面{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is there another entrance? - Around back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.43,0:31:39.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好的 我们走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.81,0:31:41.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,继续砸门{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.17,0:32:07.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,很快就结束了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll all be over soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.17,0:32:10.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,退后{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.30,0:32:15.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,狗娘养的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.43,0:32:23.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,玛格丽特{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Margaret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.02,0:32:27.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,玛格丽特{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Margaret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.25,0:33:32.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 谢天谢地 谢天谢地{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God, thank God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.42,0:33:36.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,妈咪？是的 宝贝 我就在这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy. Yeah, baby. I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.55,0:33:39.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,泰勒 你看到玛吉了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tyler, do you see Maggie anywhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.56,0:33:42.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有 她走了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, she's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.02,0:33:45.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,妈咪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.99,0:33:57.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你真的为我那么做？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd really do that for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.62,0:34:05.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.20,0:34:08.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果你做到了 我就放他们一马{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you did, I'd let them go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.71,0:34:12.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是我不明白{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.80,0:34:16.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你抗拒了我这么久{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You kept me away for so long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.55,0:34:18.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我还以为你不再爱我了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you didn't love me anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.51,0:34:25.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.43,0:34:27.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,小妹妹{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}little sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.66,0:34:42.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,别担心 亲爱的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.83,0:34:45.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们一会儿就走 只要带上外婆就走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're leaving in two minutes, we just gotta get Grandma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.00,0:34:50.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不明白了 玛吉就这么停手了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't get it. Did Maggie just stop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.46,0:34:53.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 看起来是的 - 她到底去哪了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Seems like it. - Where the hell did she go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.37,0:35:25.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,救护人员说是另一次中风导致的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The paramedics said it was another stroke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.20,0:35:27.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你觉得{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.00,0:35:30.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,玛格丽特和这事有关系吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Margaret could've had something to do with it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.87,0:35:33.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我们不知道 - 但是 有可能{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We don't know. - But it's possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.54,0:35:34.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.21,0:35:39.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,苏珊 我很抱歉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Susan, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.55,0:35:41.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我的天 你没有什么要道歉的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God, you have nothing to apologize for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.88,0:35:43.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们已经尽力了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've given me everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.81,0:35:49.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 可以走了吗 小姑娘？- 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ready to go, kiddo? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.85,0:35:51.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,泰勒 你确定玛吉不在周围了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're sure Maggie's not around anymore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.89,0:35:53.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 我能看见她{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure. I'd see her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.74,0:36:02.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想不管是什么事都已经结束了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I guess whatever's going on must be over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.08,0:36:09.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们照顾好自己 好吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two take care of yourselves, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.58,0:36:15.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.59,0:36:16.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.92,0:36:18.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们两都是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.10,0:36:29.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我还以为你可以走桃花运呢 伙计{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you could've hooked up some MILF action there, bud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.14,0:36:33.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 说真的 我觉得她喜欢你 - 是的 那是她想要的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm serious, I think she liked you. - Yeah, that's all she needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.56,0:36:36.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你救了妈妈 又救了女儿 干得不错 你知道吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you saved the mom, you saved the girl, not a bad day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.15,0:36:40.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我本可以一个人搞定的 但是我不想你觉得自己没用{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could have saved them myself but I didn't want you to feel useless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.94,0:36:43.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 谢谢了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. I appreciate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.45,0:36:46.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,能恢复状态感觉不错吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feels good getting back in the saddle, doesn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.74,0:36:48.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.78,0:36:49.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 的确{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.95,0:36:52.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是这不代表 我们昨晚说的就不算了 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it doesn't change what we talked about last night, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.29,0:36:56.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们昨晚说了很多{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We talked about a lot of things last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.00,0:36:58.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你知道我指的是什么 - 当时你喝醉了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know what I mean. - You were wasted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.09,0:37:00.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是你没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you weren't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.01,0:37:02.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,而且你保证过的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.70,0:38:18.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,2 3 4 5 6 7{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two, three, four, five, six, seven...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.17,0:38:23.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,8 9 10 11 12…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}eight, nine, 10, 11, 12...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.05,0:38:27.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,13 14 15 16…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}13, 14, 15, 16...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.01,0:38:30.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,1718{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}17, 18...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.57,0:38:50.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,34 35 36 37…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}34, 35, 36, 37...{\r}
